'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is an [[Ancient Weapons|ancient]] [[:Category:Guns|gun]] obtainable by purchasing the 30th tier during the [[Halloween Event 2026]] for 100,000 [[Candies (2026)|candies]].

== Trivia ==
*This is the first chroma ancient to ever be released.
*This pairs with the ancient knife [[Chroma Emberscythe]].
**This also pairs with the godly knife [[Chroma Embersickle]].
*This is the 9th gun to have a unique shooting sound effect, the others being [[Harvester]], [[Gingerscope]], [[Icepiercer]], [[Raygun]], [[Chroma Raygun]], [[Snowcannon]], [[Chroma Snowcannon]], and [[Emberbow]].
